{"parentUuid": null, "isSidechain": true, "promptId": "3fc27792-940c-43fc-b200-000f347f031b", "agentId": "ab572466a4e9d7bbd", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "You are implementing Task 2 of a Postgres migration plan for StudyEngine (Python/FastAPI).\n\n**Working directory:** `/Users/test/Projects/studyengine/.worktrees/postgres-migration`\n**Branch:** `postgres-migration`\n\n## Context\nRailway's Postgres plugin sets `DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@host/db`. SQLAlchemy + psycopg3 requires `postgresql+psycopg://`. We normalize at config load time so the app works transparently on Railway without manual URL fixing.\n\n## Task 2: Fix DATABASE_URL normalization in config.py\n\n**Files:**\n- Modify: `app/config.py`\n- Create: `tests/test_config.py`\n\n### Steps\n\n**Step 1: Write the failing test** \u2014 create `tests/test_config.py`:\n\n```python\nimport importlib\n\n\ndef test_railway_postgres_url_normalized(monkeypatch):\n    monkeypatch.setenv(\"DATABASE_URL\", \"postgres://user:pass@host:5432/db\")\n    import app.config as cfg\n    importlib.reload(cfg)\n    assert cfg.DATABASE_URL.startswith(\"postgresql+psycopg://\")\n\n\ndef test_postgresql_url_normalized(monkeypatch):\n    monkeypatch.setenv(\"DATABASE_URL\", \"postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/db\")\n    import app.config as cfg\n    importlib.reload(cfg)\n    assert cfg.DATABASE_URL.startswith(\"postgresql+psycopg://\")\n\n\ndef test_sqlite_url_unchanged(monkeypatch):\n    monkeypatch.setenv(\"DATABASE_URL\", \"sqlite:////data/studyengine.db\")\n    import app.config as cfg\n    importlib.reload(cfg)\n    assert cfg.DATABASE_URL == \"sqlite:////data/studyengine.db\"\n```\n\n**Step 2:** Run `python -m pytest tests/test_config.py -x -q 2>&1 | tail -8` \u2014 must FAIL\n\n**Step 3:** Add URL normalization to `app/config.py` immediately after the `DATABASE_URL` assignment:\n\n```python\n# Normalize Railway/Heroku postgres:// URLs to SQLAlchemy+psycopg3 format\nif DATABASE_URL.startswith(